    <description>A focusing technique that pushes kinetic vision to its absolute limit. The sclera turns red. The world slows. Every incoming strike becomes readable — every gap becomes exploitable. The most powerful technique in Flower Breathing, and the most dangerous. Each use tears at the blood vessels behind the eyes. Use it too freely, and the sight it depends on will be gone forever.</description>
